/ "Change": one category picker per line of the transaction (a split shows each line's amount). Each line carries the
/ category it shows now, so a category set or changed meanwhile saves nothing, and all lines are saved together
/ (Transactions::Categorise in its edit mode). No suggestion: the choice is the person's own. The picker has the
/ focus when it opens, Enter saves, Escape or "Cancel" closes it, and the focus goes back to "Change"
/ (category_change_controller.js; after a save the answer focuses it). The review queue's keys (j / k / t / c) are
/ not attached here.
- if transaction.transfer_leg?
  p.text-sm.text-ink-muted A transfer leg: it has no lines.
- elsif transaction.receipt
  p.text-sm.text-ink-muted
    | Booked from a receipt: change its items' categories on
    =< link_to "the receipt", receipt_path(transaction.receipt), data: { turbo_prefetch: false, turbo_frame: "_top" }
    | .
- else
  - currency = transaction.account.currency
  - split = transaction.lines.size > 1
  = form_with url: categories_transaction_path(transaction), method: :patch, class: "mt-2 flex flex-col gap-2",
    data: { turbo_frame: "_top", turbo_action: ("replace" if from_page), controller: "category-change",
      category_change_return_value: dom_id(transaction, :change_categories), action: "keydown->category-change#keydown" } do |f|
    = hidden_field_tag :lock_version, transaction.lock_version, id: nil
    - if from_page
      = hidden_field_tag :return_to, "page", id: nil
    - else
      - filter.to_params.each do |key, value|
        = hidden_field_tag "filter[#{key}]", value, id: nil
    - name = transaction_label(transaction)
    - transaction.lines.each do |line|
      - amount = receipt_money(line.amount, currency)
      = hidden_field_tag "lines[#{line.id}][observed_category_id]", line.category_id.to_s, id: nil
      = fields_for "lines[]", line do |l|
        .flex.flex-wrap.items-center.gap-2
          - if split
            span.text-xs.text-ink-muted.tabular-nums = amount
          .w-64
            = l.category_select :category_id, category_choices, "aria-label": (split ? "Category of the line of #{amount}, #{name}" : "Category of #{name}"),
              id: "change_category_#{line.id}", class: "combobox-compact"
    .flex.flex-wrap.items-center.gap-2
      = f.submit "Save", name: nil, variant: :primary, size: :sm
      / Opened on a page of its own there is no frame to close: Cancel goes back to the transaction.
      - if local_assigns[:standalone]
        = ui_link_button "Cancel", transaction_path(transaction), variant: :ghost, size: :sm
      - else
        = ui_button "Cancel", variant: :ghost, size: :sm, data: { action: "category-change#close" }
